  "description": "Left with nothing but debt after her father vanished before she even came of age, a young woman struggles to survive as a golf caddie, paying it off day by day. Just as she thinks she’s managing, men claiming to be her father’s old friends appear, praising her diligence while crossing unsettling boundaries. What begins as thinly veiled concern quickly turns into coercion, as they demand repayment for debts they insist her father left unpaid by any means necessary.\nSource: MU",
